From 5faa9556b1c10a4b21208615bddb7480401fa213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Mon, 19 Mar 2018 21:58:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: armada-xp-linksys-mamba: disable CPU idle

Mark the coherency fabric of the Linksys WRT1900AC v1 as broken-idle to
disable CPU idle, which causes instability on this device.
---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/marvell/armada-xp-linksys-mamba.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/marvell/armada-xp-linksys-mamba.dts
@@ -481,3 +481,7 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+&coherencyfab {
+	broken-idle;
+};
